    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more like a visual book with a psychological theme. It starts with a really sad story. You can try the free demo, which includes 50% of the full game's content, before you buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visible injuries have treatments and support, but many people live with emotional trauma for life. They pretend they\u2019re okay, act normal, and often don\u2019t even seek help. This story includes self-healing tips. I hope this story can help people with traumatic experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in these topics, you can check out: Complex PTSD: From Surviving to Thriving (Pete Walker), Manipulative Parents (Isabelle Nazare-Aga), The Body Keeps the Score: Brain, Mind, and Body in the Healing of Trauma, (Bessel van der Kolk M.D.) and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more like a visual book with a psychological theme. It starts with a really sad story. You can try the free demo, which includes 50% of the full game's content, before you buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visible injuries have treatments and support, but many people live with emotional trauma for life. They pretend they\u2019re okay, act normal, and often don\u2019t even seek help. This story includes self-healing tips. I hope this story can help people with traumatic experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in these topics, you can check out: Complex PTSD: From Surviving to Thriving (Pete Walker), Manipulative Parents (Isabelle Nazare-Aga), The Body Keeps the Score: Brain, Mind, and Body in the Healing of Trauma, (Bessel van der Kolk M.D.) and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------  </p>",
    "short_description": "It's a short, text-based interactive book with a psychological theme.\u25b6TRIGGER WARNING\u25c0 Contains childhood trauma, suicidal thoughts, and emotional abuse, but ultimately conveys hope and growth.",
