        "notes": "This game contains the following mature content:\r\n\r\n\u2765 Mental health themes: \r\nThe story explores psychological trauma, depression, and the journey of self-healing.\r\n\r\n\u2765 Self-harm and suicidal thoughts: \r\nThe protagonist experiences suicidal ideation, but the core message of the game is self-recovery and hope.\r\n\r\n\u2765 Violent scenes: \r\nSome depictions of violence, such as the protagonist facing aggression, oppression, or abuse (non-extreme violence).\r\n\r\n\u2765 Drug use: \r\nThe game includes references to medication related to mental health treatment but does not promote substance abuse.\r\n\r\n\u2765 The game\u2019s main theme is overcoming trauma and finding hope, but certain topics may be emotionally triggering for some players. Please proceed with caution."
